guarantee: AC-6 / review 1 #1 (P-004/P-005, P-009): a retry whose pending audio cannot be read back empties the slot, deletes the audio and emits one Warning{pending_audio_unreadable}; no engine, no message, no offer (read error reported as a failed retry: same id kept, reason shown again)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/pipeline.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
                self.drop_pending(entry.id);
                self.emit(DictationEvent::Warning {
                    code: WarningCode::PendingAudioUnreadable,
                });
                return None;
--- new
                return Some(JobReport {
                    end: JobEnd::Failed(entry.reason.clone()),
                    pending: Some(entry.id),
                });
--- end
